_AQMrejCmRj54RU1YvvU77c9YAu3Tj3yNEAxjrb7dqlVCNg&oe=6AC79F88"}, {"file_name": "Pirate 2 - Golfer + shark.png", "id": "1274993477981891", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618069_1274993481315224_8528695110052518896_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tDkIh9aroqMQ7kNvwGETJa6&_nc_oc=AdroWvkWVFQTRgAW5JZpHdRDtHdVBZJnYEW_dqrjcG8ax6deA7mGshgLCQG2Bwm09ac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPwsHEoiLHvQM22mMNCTJSgtSNMSdqvZ3pFQoIq2427sQ&oe=6AC7B202"}, {"file_name": "Adobe Express - file.png", "id": "4261575347491675", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619697_4261575350825008_4656764706867764070_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=O7FpoFhs8kgQ7kNvwEVbz6G&_nc_oc=Adr3nlzeHhmSirpCom7YjZY5wuTFJqbw3aIXxXYcMmhNN2fadji7TvOb3EPEMQ4cPIg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPwFQTnhV6Kfp6kKgw6gwBnpfE-5u1FZDEiWwHwxcUDfQ&oe=6AC7C563"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fruitgolf_splash_screen_psd_B.png", "id": "1541089814205533", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623585_1541089817538866_301293638521670236_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W6F77HvkecgQ7kNvwEuuA0G&_nc_oc=Adq5Al89rc0HUzoyPU1j7DJgVDMQscKMINUIJk6sy_4VyPr7frIl9bpKb_ymnaHLY_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPuRBoljLF8gyXNO74l3Zv7mNJSSluM3yv8qU5CkQ-Rlw&oe=6AC7CC90"}, "display_name": "Fruit Golf", "keywords": ["family", "party", "multiplayer", "coop", "battle"], "long_description": "# A Party Game Built on Pure Sabotage.\nTake turns surviving the course while your friends unleash sabotage; sharks, explosions, flying pigs, and total nonsense. Winning is optional. Ruining someone else\u2019s turn is mandatory.\n{1178795550894396}\n**Choose Carefully. Every Fruit Plays by Different Rules.** Every fruit bends the rules in its own way, with unique physics and quirks that can turn a simple putt into a power move\u2026 If you can master it! \n{871299389056939}\n# HOW TO PLAY:\n\n# MULTIPLE HEADSETS\nGo head-to-head in VR! Online or in-person, take turns golfing and sabotaging.\n\n# ONE HEADSET HOTSEAT\nOne headset, many saboteurs! Friends join FREE on phones (www.fruitgolf.com) to wreak havoc.\n\n# SOLO PRACTICE\nHone your swing, conquer challenges, and enjoy the hilarious physics of Fruit Golf! \n{2057401171694269}**Unlock the Drip. Flex the Chaos.** Crush challenges, unlock ridiculous gear, and make sure everyone knows you did it first.\n{861375006303270}**Weaponized Nonsense.** Sabotage every move with floppy sharks, ectoplasm, portals, mouse traps and more! If it causes chaos, it\u2019s fair game.\n{3524926690977542}**Golf Course or Battle Arena?** Fight it out in wildly themed spaces; underwater, in orbit, on the kitchen counter, then stack the deck with obstacles and turn it into pure mayhem!", "short_description": "A Game Built on Sabotage! One headset, many saboteurs! Mobile friends join for FREE (www.fruitgolf.com) to add to the chaos. \n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fruitgolf.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Coal Car Studio", "support_website_url": "https://www.fruitgolf.com/contact-us", "website_url": "https://www.fruitgolf.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "SOCIAL", "SPORTS"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_playe